fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266SubLayerHRDParameters","fragment":"\n\tGstH266SubLayerHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SubLayerHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SubLayerHRDParameters\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 sub layer HDR parameters.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\ntogether with cpb_size_scale to specify the CPB size.\ntogether with cpb_size_du_scale to specify\nthe CPB size.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\nspecifies whether to decode this bitstream by the HRD using\nthe CPB specification.\nthe calculated bit rate.\nthe calculated cpb size.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 sub layer HDR parameters.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\ntogether with cpb_size_scale to specify the CPB size.\ntogether with cpb_size_du_scale to specify\nthe CPB size.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\nspecifies whether to decode this bitstream by the HRD using\nthe CPB specification.\nthe calculated bit rate.\nthe calculated cpb size.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 sub layer HDR parameters.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\ntogether with cpb_size_scale to specify the CPB size.\ntogether with cpb_size_du_scale to specify\nthe CPB size.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate for the CPB.\nspecifies whether to decode this bitstream by the HRD using\nthe CPB specification.\nthe calculated bit rate.\nthe calculated cpb size.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});